  {
    "hotel_id": "1044262",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/cassia-phuket/hotel/phuket-th.html",
    "name": "Cassia Phuket",
    "detail": "Our room is a 2-bedroom loft with water view, which offered gorgeous view overlooking lagoon and the ocean, especially during sunset. I however did not give 5-star for hotel location, because the beach is not outside of our door. Instead, to go to the beach, we need to walk about 5-10 min, depending on how fast we walk. The hotel did provide a shuttle boat there though, which ran from ~8 am - 8 pm. The room was clean. The staff was friendly. However, they were trying to get us to stay in other room type at first when we booked our room 3-4 months in advance, but essentially after persisting on staying in the type of the room we booked, they gave us the room. Some other minor drawbacks for the place: quite limited food for breakfast and the room was somewhat smaller than expected. Overall, I really love the hotel and Bangtao beach, which is most peaceful compared to other beaches in Phuket, and I would definitely come back.",
